      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시로 님이 부재중이신 동안\n저 자신을 돌아보고 싶어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCB85C0020B2D8C7740020BD80C7ACC911C774C2E00020B3D9C548000AC8000020C790C2E0C7440020B3CCC544BCF4ACE00020C2F6C5B4C694002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저와 시합할 준비가 되셨다면\n제게 말을 걸어 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C6400020C2DCD569D5600020C900BE44AC000020B418C168B2E4BA74000AC81CAC8C0020B9D0C7440020AC78C5B40020C8FCC138C694002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저와 시합해 주실 건가요?\n아니면 기술플러스 때문에 오셨나요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C6400020C2DCD569D5740020C8FCC2E40020AC74AC00C694003F000AC544B2C8BA740020AE30C220D50CB7ECC2A40020B54CBB38C5D00020C624C168B098C694003F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시합해요!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCD569D574C69400210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "기술플러스...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AE30C220D50CB7ECC2A4002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "아무 일도 아니에요",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C544BB340020C77CB3C40020C544B2C8C5D0C6940000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇군요... <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨에게도\n사정이 있으시겠죠...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807AD70C694002E002E002E002000100002010000000020C528C5D0AC8CB3C4000AC0ACC815C7740020C788C73CC2DCACA0C8E0002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "ZA로열 A랭크에게\n한 수 배우도록 하겠습니다!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005A0041B85CC5F400200041B7ADD06CC5D0AC8C000AD55C0020C2180020BC30C6B0B3C4B85D0020D558ACA0C2B5B2C8B2E4002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저와 시합해 주실 건가요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800C6400020C2DCD569D5740020C8FCC2E40020AC74AC00C694003F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨는\n미르 최강의 트레이너시네요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC002000100002010000000020C528B294000ABBF8B9740020CD5CAC15C7580020D2B8B808C774B108C2DCB124C694002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그에 비하면 저는...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8C5D00020BE44D558BA740020C800B294002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "조금도 강해지지 않았어요...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C870AE08B3C40020AC15D574C9C0C9C00020C54AC558C5B4C694002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "이래서는 저스티스회는 물론이고\n시로 님의 평판까지 떨어지고 말 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C774B798C11CB2940020C800C2A4D2F0C2A4D68CB2940020BB3CB860C774ACE0000AC2DCB85C0020B2D8C7580020D3C9D310AE4CC9C00020B5A8C5B4C9C0ACE00020B9D00020AC70C608C694002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저는 정말 저스티스회에\n필요한 사람인 걸까요?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800B2940020C815B9D00020C800C2A4D2F0C2A4D68CC5D0000AD544C694D55C0020C0ACB78CC7780020AC78AE4CC694003F00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "쿠오오오!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CFE0C624C624C624002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "크허어엉!!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "D06CD5C8C5B4C5C9002100210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "저, 저 녀석들은\n불한당 브라더스!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C800002C0020C8000020B140C11DB4E4C740000ABD88D55CB2F90020BE0CB77CB354C2A4002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "와일드 존을 무시하고\n여기저기서 날뛰는 부란다 듀오예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C640C77CB4DC0020C874C7440020BB34C2DCD558ACE0000AC5ECAE30C800AE30C11C0020B0A0B6F0B2940020BD80B780B2E40020B4C0C624C608C694002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시로 님조차 겨우 쫓아내는\n위험한 포켓몬인데...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCB85C0020B2D8C870CC280020ACA8C6B00020CAD3C544B0B4B294000AC704D5D8D55C0020D3ECCF13BAACC778B370002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그렇지만, 시로 님이 부재중인 동안\n도장을 지키는 것이 저, 코타네의 사명!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8B807C9C0B9CC002C0020C2DCB85C0020B2D8C7740020BD80C7ACC911C7780020B3D9C548000AB3C4C7A5C7440020C9C0D0A4B2940020AC83C7740020C800002C0020CF54D0C0B124C7580020C0ACBA85002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨!\n저와 함께 싸워 주세요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1572,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C5280021000AC800C6400020D568AED80020C2F8C6CC0020C8FCC138C694002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
