      "offsetInSection": 1680,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CFE0C624003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "불한당 브라더스 여러분!\n출구는 저쪽이에요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "BD88D55CB2F90020BE0CB77CB354C2A40020C5ECB7ECBD840021000ACD9CAD6CB2940020C800CABDC774C5D0C694002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "시로 님...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C2DCB85C0020B2D8002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨, 코타네...\n설마, 방금 그 부란다들을 둘이서...?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
