      "offsetInSection": 1772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000000020C528002C0020CF54D0C0B124002E002E002E000AC124B9C8002C0020BC29AE080020ADF80020BD80B780B2E4B4E4C7440020B458C774C11C002E002E002E003F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "넵! 도장을 어지럽히려고 해서\n<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨와 함께 쫓아냈어요!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1856,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B13500210020B3C4C7A5C7440020C5B4C9C0B7FDD788B824ACE00020D574C11C000A00100002010000000020C528C6400020D568AED80020CAD3C544B0C8C5B4C694002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "역시 미르의 구세주.\n조금이나마 그 실력을 알 수 있었어요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C5EDC2DC0020BBF8B974C7580020AD6CC138C8FC002E000AC870AE08C774B098B9C80020ADF80020C2E4B825C7440020C54C0020C2180020C788C5C8C5B4C694002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "그에 비하면 저는...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "ADF8C5D00020BE44D558BA740020C800B294002E002E002E00100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코타네.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54D0C0B124002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "넵!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "B135002100100002011400330000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "정말 실력이 없었다면 <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> 씨와\n함께 싸울 수 없었을 거예요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2084,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C815B9D00020C2E4B825C7740020C5C6C5C8B2E4BA74002000100002010000000020C528C640000AD568AED80020C2F8C6B80020C2180020C5C6C5C8C7440020AC70C608C694002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "애초에 제가 도장을 비울 수 있었던 것도\n코타네가 지켜 줄 거라 믿었기 때문이구요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "C560CD08C5D00020C81CAC000020B3C4C7A5C7440020BE44C6B80020C2180020C788C5C8B3580020AC83B3C4000ACF54D0C0B124AC000020C9C0CF1C0020C9040020AC70B77C0020BBFFC5C8AE300020B54CBB38C774AD6CC694002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "강한 사람에 비해 자신을 낮출 수 있다는 건\n상대와의 차이를 잘 알고 있다는 증거...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "AC15D55C0020C0ACB78CC5D00020BE44D5740020C790C2E0C7440020B0AECD9C0020C2180020C788B2E4B2940020AC74000AC0C1B300C640C7580020CC28C774B97C0020C7980020C54CACE00020C788B2E4B2940020C99DAC70002E002E002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "코타네는 앞으로 더 강해질 수 있을 테니\n다음엔 저와 같이 부란다를 쫓아내 봐요.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "CF54D0C0B124B2940020C55EC73CB85C0020B3540020AC15D574C9C80020C2180020C788C7440020D14CB2C8000AB2E4C74CC5D40020C800C6400020AC19C7740020BD80B780B2E4B97C0020CAD3C544B0B40020BD10C694002E00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 50
    },
    {
      "displayText": "넵!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ3",
